 11+++64CC              ; a 32-bit byte offset; page numbers and the 16 KiB mapping window are private.
 12+++64CC              ; READ/WRITE/STREAM operations will use the same mapper and split internally.
 13+++64CC              ;
 14+++64CC              ; Reserved pages are based on the Project112 ATM2+ memory map and the P127
